--
`ownAccountIbans` in `workflows/bank-sync.ts` normalizes with `.replace(/s/g, "")` instead of `/\s/g`, so it removes the letter "s" rather than spaces. An own IBAN stored with spaces is never matched, and the letter is dropped from the comparison.

